      "value": "You need to make sure the mirror mesh lies on the XY plane in the mesh renderer’s local coordinate system, and its facing direction is negative Z-axis in the local coordinate system.\nAs long as you follow this rule, you can shape it, add holes to or do whatever you might want to do except curve it.",
